    description: "UAT 2026-04-13 BUG-10: at Vet.java:66, `getSpecialtiesInternal().size()` (a `List.size()` call) is reported as `java.nio.file.Files.size`. The Java io-boundary catalog matches the unqualified method name without verifying receiver type. Same pattern as the Go INV-dihos issue. Likely subsumed by U14 if implemented type-aware, but kept as a separate item to track the specific fix and prevent regression."  # 3430
